    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Process\n\nThis type of Agentic Framework will give us faster analysis rather than processing everything linearly .\n\nAgent 1 : will analyse the emotion behind it \nAgent 2 : intent behind it \nAgent 3 : Analyse any bias rather than doing it one by one \n\nALL three Ai agents will work simultaneously and then throwing their outputs together. so it can decrease latency there . They are specialized which means every agent has own prompt and system message , we can also use different chat models for each AI agents as per required output and we combine all agent to get best answer. Comprehensive review and then more scalability as well\n\n**Eg : to Chat model : I dont trust the mainstream media anymore. They always push a specific agenda and ignored real issues. People need to wake up and stop believing everything they see on the news** ",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 736,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1248,
        -1056
      ],
      "id": "52b78df7-9df8-430c-87fb-9ec3565a7920",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Parallelization\n\n☑️ Faster Analysis – Instead of sequential analysis, all aspects are evaluated in parallel.\n\n☑️ Specialized AI Agents – Each LLM focuses on a single analytical area, improving accuracy.\n\n☑️ Comprehensive Review – The final aggregation step ensures clarity and a well-structured report.\n\n☑️ Scalability – Can be extended to analyze additional text properties (e.g., readability, factual accuracy).\n",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 736,
        "color": 4
      },
